---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { achievements } from '../data/achievements';
import { activities, faqs, sources, socialLinks, universityContact } from '../data/content';
---
<section class="bg-quiet pt-[58px] pb-11 mobile:pt-11 mobile:pb-[30px]" id="layanan" aria-labelledby="services-title">
  <div class="container mx-auto w-[min(1232px,calc(100%_-_112px))] compact:w-[calc(100%_-_64px)] mobile:w-[calc(100%_-_40px)]">
    <div class="block">
      <div class="block [&>p]:mt-3.5 [&>p]:max-w-[60ch] [&>p]:text-[1rem] [&>p]:text-muted">
        <h2 id="services-title" class="font-editorial font-medium leading-[1.12] tracking-[-.035em] text-balance text-[clamp(2.15rem,3.4vw,3.1rem)]">Butuh arahan?</h2>
        <p>Pilih layanan sesuai kebutuhanmu. Semua tautan mengarah ke kanal resmi SiberMu.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-3 stack:mt-6 stack:grid-cols-1">
        <a class="
          flex items-start justify-between gap-5 px-7 py-0 first:pl-0 last:pr-0 not-first:border-l
          not-first:border-[#cad9e7] [&_strong]:text-[1.05rem] [&_strong]:font-semibold [&_small]:mt-2.5
          [&_small]:block [&_small]:text-[.94rem] [&_small]:text-muted [&>svg]:mt-1 [&>svg]:text-blue
          hover:[&_strong]:text-blue hover:[&_strong]:underline stack:px-0 stack:py-5 stack:not-first:border-t
          stack:not-first:border-l-0 stack:[&_small]:mt-1.5
        " href={sources.academicHelp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span><strong>Bantuan akademik</strong><small>Kontak akademik, persuratan, reset akun, dan keuangan.</small></span><Icon name="diagonal" size={19}/></a>
        <a class="
          flex items-start justify-between gap-5 px-7 py-0 first:pl-0 last:pr-0 not-first:border-l
          not-first:border-[#cad9e7] [&_strong]:text-[1.05rem] [&_strong]:font-semibold [&_small]:mt-2.5
          [&_small]:block [&_small]:text-[.94rem] [&_small]:text-muted [&>svg]:mt-1 [&>svg]:text-blue
          hover:[&_strong]:text-blue hover:[&_strong]:underline stack:px-0 stack:py-5 stack:not-first:border-t
          stack:not-first:border-l-0 stack:[&_small]:mt-1.5
        " href={sources.studentPortal} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span><strong>Portal Mahasiswa</strong><small>Akses layanan menggunakan akun mahasiswa SiberMu.</small></span><Icon name="diagonal" size={19}/></a>
        <a class="
          flex items-start justify-between gap-5 px-7 py-0 first:pl-0 last:pr-0 not-first:border-l
          not-first:border-[#cad9e7] [&_strong]:text-[1.05rem] [&_strong]:font-semibold [&_small]:mt-2.5
          [&_small]:block [&_small]:text-[.94rem] [&_small]:text-muted [&>svg]:mt-1 [&>svg]:text-blue
          hover:[&_strong]:text-blue hover:[&_strong]:underline stack:px-0 stack:py-5 stack:not-first:border-t
          stack:not-first:border-l-0 stack:[&_small]:mt-1.5
        " href={sources.admissions} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span><strong>Informasi KIP Kuliah</strong><small>Kenali persyaratan dan informasi pada laman Admisi.</small></span><Icon name="diagonal" size={19}/></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="
      mt-[38px] grid grid-cols-[.72fr_1.28fr] gap-[72px] border-t border-[#cad9e7] pt-7
      compact:gap-x-11 tablet:grid-cols-[.7fr_1.3fr] tablet:gap-8 stack:grid-cols-1 stack:gap-[26px] mobile:mt-6
      mobile:pt-[26px]
    ">
      <h3 class="font-editorial text-[1.65rem] font-medium tracking-[-.025em]">Sebelum melangkah.</h3>
      <div class="
        [&>details]:border-b [&>details]:border-line [&>details:last-child]:border-b-0
        [&>details:first-child>summary]:pt-0 [&>details>p]:pb-2 [&>details>p]:text-[.94rem]
        [&>details>p]:text-muted
      ">{faqs.map(faq => <details><summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-7 py-[18px] text-[.94rem] font-medium mobile:gap-5">{faq.question}<Icon name="plus" size={19} class="transition-transform duration-200 ease-[ease] [[open]>summary>&]:rotate-45"/></summary><p>{faq.answer}</p><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-[13px] font-semibold hover:underline mb-3 text-[.94rem] text-blue" href={faq.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{faq.linkLabel} <Icon name="diagonal" size={16}/></a></details>)}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="closing-backdrop relative text-paper [&_:focus-visible]:outline-sky" aria-labelledby="closing-title">
  <div class="
    container mx-auto w-[min(1232px,calc(100%_-_112px))] compact:w-[calc(100%_-_64px)]
    mobile:w-[calc(100%_-_40px)] flex min-h-[230px] items-center justify-between gap-12 pt-11
    pb-7 stack:min-h-0 stack:flex-col stack:items-start stack:gap-[26px] mobile:pt-[38px] mobile:pb-6
    [&_h2+p]:mt-[17px] [&_h2+p]:text-[1rem] [&_h2+p]:text-inverse
  ">
    <div><h2 id="closing-title" class="font-editorial font-medium leading-[1.12] tracking-[-.035em] text-balance text-[clamp(2rem,3.2vw,2.8rem)] text-paper">Masa kuliahmu adalah<br />sebuah perjalanan.</h2><p>Temukan teman belajar. Kembangkan minatmu. Ambil bagian.</p></div>
    <a class="
      inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-[25px] rounded-md border border-transparent
      font-semibold transition-[background,translate] duration-200 ease-[ease] hover:-translate-y-0.5
      min-h-[50px] shrink-0 bg-paper px-[22px] py-[13px] text-[.92rem] text-navy hover:bg-sky
    " href="#komunitas">Temukan komunitasmu <Icon size={18}/></a>
  </div>
  <p class="
    container mx-auto w-[min(1232px,calc(100%_-_112px))] compact:w-[calc(100%_-_64px)]
    mobile:w-[calc(100%_-_40px)] pb-3.5 text-right text-[.75rem] text-inverse
  ">Ilustrasi AI · Bangunan fiktif</p>
</section>
<footer class="bg-night pt-[53px] text-white [&_:focus-visible]:outline-sky mobile:pt-10"><div class="container mx-auto w-[min(1232px,calc(100%_-_112px))] compact:w-[calc(100%_-_64px)] mobile:w-[calc(100%_-_40px)]">
  <div class="
    relative grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.4fr)_minmax(0,.85fr)_minmax(0,.85fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)]
    items-start justify-between gap-9 pb-[35px] [&>*]:min-w-0 compact:grid-cols-2 compact:gap-x-12
    compact:gap-y-9 mobile:gap-x-5 mobile:gap-y-7
  ">
    <div class="compact:pr-0 mobile:col-span-full">
      <a class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2.5 text-paper" href="#beranda">
        <span class="
          block shrink-0 overflow-hidden [&>img]:h-full [&>img]:w-auto [&>img]:max-w-none h-[42px] w-12
          mobile:h-[38.5px] mobile:w-11 [&>img]:brightness-0 [&>img]:invert
        " aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/sibermu-emblem-official.webp" width="208" height="182" alt="" loading="lazy" /></span>
        <span class="
          block min-w-0 [&>strong]:block [&>strong]:font-display [&>strong]:font-bold
          [&>strong]:leading-[1.3] [&>strong]:uppercase [&>small]:block [&>small]:font-normal [&>small]:leading-[1.4]
          [&>strong]:text-[1rem] [&>small]:mt-1 [&>small]:text-[.75rem] [&>small]:text-inverse
        "><strong>Kemahasiswaan & AIK</strong><small>Universitas Siber Muhammadiyah</small></span>
      </a>
      <p class="mt-3.5 max-w-[31ch] text-[.9375rem] text-inverse">Ruang Tumbuh SiberMu.<br />Terhubung. Bertumbuh. Berkontribusi.</p>
      <nav class="mt-5 flex flex-nowrap gap-2" aria-label="Media sosial SiberMu">
        {socialLinks.map(social => <a class="flex h-11 flex-[0_0_44px] items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-[#3d5772] text-inverse hover:text-paper hover:underline hover:underline-offset-4" href={social.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label={`${social.name} SiberMu (tab baru)`} title={social.name}><Icon name={social.icon} size={22}/></a>)}
      </nav>
    </div>
    <nav class="
      m-0 flex flex-col items-start gap-3 text-[.9375rem] [&>a]:text-inverse [&>a:hover]:underline
      compact:first-of-type:pr-[58px] mobile:first-of-type:pr-0
    " aria-label="Jelajahi halaman"><h3 class="mb-1.5 font-sans text-[.94rem] font-semibold text-paper">Jelajahi</h3><a href="#komunitas">Organisasi & komunitas</a><a href="#aik">Al-Islam & Kemuhammadiyahan</a><a href="#prestasi">Prestasi mahasiswa</a><a href="#kegiatan">Dokumentasi kegiatan</a></nav>
    <nav class="
      m-0 flex flex-col items-start gap-3 text-[.9375rem] [&>a]:text-inverse [&>a:hover]:underline
      compact:first-of-type:pr-[58px] mobile:first-of-type:pr-0
    " aria-label="Kanal resmi SiberMu"><h3 class="mb-1.5 font-sans text-[.94rem] font-semibold text-paper">Kanal resmi</h3><a href={sources.university} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Website SiberMu</a><a href={sources.studentPortal} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Portal Mahasiswa</a><a href={sources.academicHelp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bantuan akademik</a><a href={sources.admissions} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Admisi & KIP Kuliah</a></nav>
    <section class="
      mobile:col-span-full mobile:border-t mobile:border-[#3d5772] mobile:pt-6 [&_a]:inline-block
      [&_a]:text-paper [&_a]:[overflow-wrap:anywhere] [&_a:hover]:underline [&_a:hover]:underline-offset-4
    " aria-labelledby="footer-contact-title">
      <h3 id="footer-contact-title" class="mb-1.5 pr-[54px] font-sans text-[.94rem] font-semibold text-paper">Hubungi kampus</h3>
      <address class="mt-5 grid gap-[18px] text-[.9375rem] leading-[1.65] not-italic">
        <div><span class="mb-[3px] block text-[.8125rem] text-inverse">Humas universitas</span><a href={`mailto:${universityContact.email}`}>{universityContact.email}</a></div>
        <div><span class="mb-[3px] block text-[.8125rem] text-inverse">WhatsApp</span><a href={universityContact.whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{universityContact.phone}</a></div>
        <div><span class="mb-[3px] block text-[.8125rem] text-inverse">Kampus pusat</span><a href={universityContact.maps} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{universityContact.address}</a></div>
      </address>
    </section>
    <a href="#beranda" class="
      absolute top-0 right-0 flex size-[46px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border
      border-[#718ba5] [&>svg]:-rotate-90 tablet:col-start-2 tablet:justify-self-end mobile:static
      mobile:col-span-full
    " aria-label="Kembali ke atas"><Icon name="arrow" size={24}/></a>
  </div>
  <details class="
    border-t border-[#3d5772] [&>div]:max-w-[900px] [&>div]:pb-6 [&>div]:text-[.875rem]
    [&>div]:text-inverse [&_ul]:mt-2.5 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-5 [&_li]:my-1.5 [&_a]:underline
  " id="kredit">
    <summary class="flex items-center gap-3 py-[18px] text-[.875rem] text-inverse">Sumber konten & kredit aset <Icon name="plus" size={17}/></summary>
    <div>
      <p>Konsep landing page untuk kebutuhan lomba 2026. Halaman ini belum menjadi layanan resmi Universitas Siber Muhammadiyah.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Organisasi dan UKM: <a href={sources.spmi} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">direktori dokumen resmi SiberMu, bagian C.3 Mahasiswa</a>, yang memuat laporan prestasi dan profil UKM serta SK pembina UKM. Profil UKM juga merujuk <a href={sources.businessClubPost} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">unggahan UKM Bisnis Digital</a> dan <a href={sources.digitalCreatorPost} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">unggahan resmi SiberMu tentang Digital Creator</a>.</li>
        <li>Prestasi dan dokumentasi: {achievements.map((item, index) => <Fragment>{index > 0 && "; "}<a href={item.source} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{item.shortNames} ({item.year})</a></Fragment>)}. Bersumber dari Instagram @sibermu dan berita resmi kampus.</li>
        <li>Kegiatan kemahasiswaan: {activities.filter(item => item.category === 'mahasiswa').map((item, index) => <Fragment>{index > 0 && "; "}<a href={item.source} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{item.title} ({item.timing})</a></Fragment>)}. Tanggal kegiatan mengikuti isi berita dan dapat berbeda dari tanggal terbit artikel.</li>
        <li>Program AIK: <a href={sources.rectorReport} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Laporan Rektor 2024, halaman 9–10</a>. Nilai AIK: <a href={sources.values} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Risalah Islam Berkemajuan, Khazanah Muhammadiyah</a>.</li>
        <li>Layanan: <a href={sources.academicHelp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">artikel bantuan akademik</a>, <a href={sources.studentPortal} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Portal Mahasiswa</a>, dan <a href={sources.admissions} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">laman Admisi SiberMu</a>.</li>
        <li>Media sosial: <a href={sources.socialDirectory} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">direktori SiberMu</a>. Email dan alamat: <a href={sources.profile} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">profil resmi kampus</a>. Nomor WhatsApp mengacu pada brief lomba.</li>
        <li>Lambang header dan footer diambil dari <a href={sources.logo} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">logo pada situs resmi SiberMu</a>. Bagian lambang dipadukan dengan teks identitas halaman; pada footer lambang ditampilkan dalam warna putih.</li>
        <li>Ilustrasi hero, komunitas, AIK, dan penutup dibuat dengan OpenAI Imagegen. Tokoh dan bangunannya bersifat fiktif. Poster serta sertifikat pada bagian prestasi merupakan dokumentasi dari sumber kampus yang ditautkan di atas.</li>
        <li>Font disediakan melalui Fontsource dengan SIL Open Font License 1.1: <a href="/licenses/Source-Serif-4-OFL.txt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Source Serif 4</a>, <a href="/licenses/Manrope-OFL.txt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Manrope</a>, dan <a href="/licenses/Public-Sans-OFL.txt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Public Sans</a>.</li>
        <li>Ikon pengguna, buku, dan hati diadaptasi dari <a href="https://github.com/feathericons/feather" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Feather Icons oleh Cole Bemis</a> dengan <a href="/licenses/Feather-MIT.txt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">lisensi MIT</a>. Ikon lainnya ditulis sebagai SVG inline.</li>
        <li>Simbol Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, dan Facebook digunakan untuk mengenali tautan ke masing-masing platform. Favicon geometris dibuat untuk konsep halaman ini dan bukan logo resmi universitas.</li>
        <li>Tanggal dan tahun menunjukkan waktu kegiatan, capaian, publikasi, atau laporan sesuai keterangannya. Dokumentasi tersebut tidak menyatakan bahwa pendaftaran atau rekrutmen sedang dibuka.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </details>
  <div class="flex justify-between gap-5 border-t border-[#3d5772] py-[21px] text-[.8125rem] text-inverse mobile:flex-col mobile:gap-[5px]"><span>Kemahasiswaan & AIK · Universitas Siber Muhammadiyah</span></div>
</div></footer>
